sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Customer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>MyReportsPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewMyIssueReportBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewMyIssueReportController
  participant IssueReport as «entity»<br/>IssueReport
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: open one of my reports
  UI->>B: GET /api/issue-reports/mine/{id} (JWT)
  B->>C: view(Integer reporterId, Integer reportId)
  alt report of another user
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 404 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>IssueReport: findById()
  IssueReport->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>IssueReport: rows
  IssueReport-->>C: result
  C-->>B: IssueReportResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end